# Sunrise Gen AI — design system

`DESIGN-SYSTEM-LOCKED.md` at the repository root is authoritative. The December 2024
Orbitron / neon lock is void; do not restore it.

## Palette

`--void #000816` · `--void-deep #00040D` · `--sun #D9661C` · `--hot #FAC345` ·
`--teal #06B6C3` · `--bone #F2EDE4` · `--ink #0A0C10`, plus off-white text.
Never `#00F5FF`, `#FF6B35`, `#FFD23F`.

## Type

Self-hosted from `public/fonts`, committed to the repo, SIL OFL:

- Display / wordmark / headings: **Cormorant Garamond** (variable 300–700 + italic)
- Body / labels / UI: **Source Serif 4** (variable 200–900), 16–18px

No Orbitron. No Geist, Inter, IBM Plex, Arial, `system-ui`, or any default SaaS
grotesque as the page voice. No runtime request to fonts.googleapis.com — `@font-face`
lives in `src/app/globals.css`.

## Page order

Fold → 01 Consulting (pinned engagement rail + capability matrix) → 02 OpenStinger →
03 Ingre (light chapter) → 04 Media (one sentence) → 05 Contact.

## Content rules

- **Ingre must stay on the page** and is written as a pitch: "Scan food and beauty
  labels. See harmful ingredients." Android and iOS. ingre.ai.
- Never write, for Ingre: Play testing, Google testing, Mac Studio, Flutter,
  "in development", or LabelSaber.
- Never write: a Gmail address, Hyderabad, a film reel or named short films,
  Job Book, Swaram, Lensort, parked domains, PBL, or study forks.
- No invented case studies, clients, or metrics. Consulting content is Verizon,
  Circana (60% / 75% / 3×), Thermo Fisher, CVS Health, and the earlier-work band.
- Contact is Wellington, FL · sbellary@sunrisegenai.com · 440-340-8383.

## Build

Next.js App Router with `output: 'export'`. `npm run build` must pass and the existing
GitHub Pages workflow must keep deploying without changes.
